{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_03_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_03","title":"安全屋攻防戰","storyCode":"OD-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"55204ad149315530f657c16fc4dd12e206c2068830857c2c404d313d18c9b9de","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷鳴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊......我的眼睛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"術師呢！幹掉那個瓦伊凡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想都別想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況，又多了一批人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼搞的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"情況不妙，這些人的火力太兇猛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不要在這裡節外生枝，先撤退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我看見你了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"小心狙擊手！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"媽的，在哪？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"別找了，撤了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你跑不掉的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"撤！快撤！別管了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FROST","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"他們跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"報告情況！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山大，你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，皮外傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"這些傢伙學聰明了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不要放鬆警惕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"還有其他人在這。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......已經靠得夠近了，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我感謝你們出手相助，但是在我們彼此搞清狀況以前，還是保持一點安全距離比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要緊張，我們沒有敵意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是羅德島的外勤小隊！你們現在駐紮的區域是羅德島的安全屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是來回應安全屋的求援信號的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你們表明身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜點，我們是來幫忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"是那個羅德島的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，還真的把救兵叫來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"去叫奧克芬先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島幹員？太好了啊，得救了！得救了啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"具體的情況就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"所以最後這四個雇傭兵就在這裡搭建了臨時陣地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"實在是抱歉，通訊器被破壞了，安全屋也沒守住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你們要是現在就辭退我，我也沒什麼怨言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不要擔心，老夫也沒有辭退你的權力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"而且依老夫來看，你能堅持到現在已經很了不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是你，這些感染者的命運會更糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有多少感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算上外面那個醫生，總共四十三個人，都是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那四個傭兵一直在保護這些感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"主動保護感染者的傭兵，這年頭可太少見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全不歧視感染者，甚至主動保護感染者的雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是我太多疑了，這是從哪兒來的聖人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他們好像沒有這個意識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"聽他們的語氣，感覺只是保護了普通的無辜鎮民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與其說是“不歧視”感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們更像是“不在乎礦石病”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他們看起來也不像是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒有見過他們這樣的傭兵，也沒聽說過“虹彩小隊”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都拿著銃哎，而且怎麼看都不是薩科塔人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非薩科塔人已經有辦法把“日光燈”藏起來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非薩科塔雇傭兵全員裝備大型銃器，這絕對會變成大新聞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鋼裝備研發部門的人知道了這件事，絕對要發瘋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......還是不要在背後議論別人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，他們救助了羅德島的幹員，保護了感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有證據之前，我們也不該懷疑他們的動機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"當務之急，是想辦法解決目前的困境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要和他們商量一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"他們進去有一陣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這個羅德島，你怎麼看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FROST","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實一直很好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FROST","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼樣的製藥企業和醫療公司，會需要在偏遠的邊陲城鎮周邊安插一個堆滿了軍火的安全屋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FROST","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"那些爆炸物和武器，都能武裝一個步兵班了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這些“製藥公司”的幹員，看起來各個都是專業武裝人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛是這世界裡當醫生都得武裝到牙齒了，要嘛製藥企業是個幌子，可能兩者皆有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"他們雖然是武裝人員，但是看起來訓練有素，而且談吐得體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"和我們之前遇到的歪瓜裂棗可不太一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是我的錯覺，但是我總能從他們身上感覺到很熟悉的氛圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，我倒是同意你的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"至少他們是講道理的文明人，我之前對這整個世界的印象就是個土匪流寇遍地走的末日啟示錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口包紮好了，亞歷山大先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，你瞭解這個叫作羅德島的組織嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我從大篷車商隊那裡聽到過一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是專門救治感染者的組織，也是研究礦石病的科研機構。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這種病不是治不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實過去有不少人自稱“能夠治癒礦石病”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人大部分是騙子，騙局敗露之後各個下場淒慘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極少數不是騙子的人，也都是誇大了“抑制礦石病症狀”的效果，這些能夠“抑制礦石病”的藥物也極其昂貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前聽說，某個領主的女兒得了礦石病，這位領主為了救自己的女兒，從哥倫比亞高價購買了抑制藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾年以後，領主的財富全部消耗殆盡，他的女兒也在病痛中死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你們看這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是安全屋裡儲備的礦石病抑制藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天我給一些病重的人注射了這種藥，它確實能夠有效抑制礦石病，而且藥效比我以前見過的所有產品都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的藥......一定非常昂貴吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是奧克芬先生完全不在乎這件事，當我告訴他有人病得非常嚴重，他就給了我一盒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是不相信這片大地上有好人，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，這我倒是真沒想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"別多想了，猜忌的成本太高。不管你是否表露出來，都不利於接下來的溝通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"既然大家的目標是一致的，很多事情不妨直接放到檯面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，他們出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，讓各位久等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我省略客套話吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們救了奧克芬，若不是你們，羅德島會失去一位盡職盡責的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這次任務結束後，我會提交報告，羅德島會給四位合適的報酬與物資補償。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"報酬啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"有報酬是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，你們願意為感染者挺身而出，老夫由衷地表示敬佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"這些鎮民這段時間也幫了我們很多，見死不救不是我們的行事風格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們是雇傭兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我們就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是雇傭兵，很貴的那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能透漏一下你們所屬的公司嗎？像你們這樣的雇傭兵實在是太少見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我們是......呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"（俄語）幫忙想個公司名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"（俄語）北極熊物流？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不方便透漏也沒有關係，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我們來自一個很遙遠的國家，在......在南邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"對！我們來自很南邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"南邊？薩爾貢南邊？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"穿過焚風熱土？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"焚......對，就是來自那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"穿過焚風熱土還有其他國家？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這可真是......震撼老夫，這麼多年來可是第一次聽說這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是薩爾貢王酋的歷史記載中，也從未提及有人曾經穿越乾旱之地而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"（俄語）你編故事也稍微好一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"（俄語）北極熊物流聽起來就比較好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，操著烏薩斯和維多利亞口音的戰士們，你們來自何處都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你們願意為感染者而戰，在這件事上我們的目的是一致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"至少現在，至少我們能夠一起面對現在的困境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意你的看法，老先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，誰能告訴我們，鎮子上到底出什麼事了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲傭兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"操縱怪物的，應該是術師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"有組織，有紀律，更重要的是懂得知難而退，這不是臨時起意的劫掠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的裝備齊全，全都是哥倫比亞產的軍備，之前圍攻安全屋的時候，還有幾個很厲害的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"這個裝備和戰術，應該是簽了“紅標合約”的專業傭兵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這恐怕是一場針對領主的叛亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他們為什麼要襲擊平民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"他們從感染者社區一路跟著我們到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"這些傭兵到底想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最大的可能性是滅口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕不只是要滅口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼看的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"他們昨天襲擊感染者社區的時候，很明顯是沖著病人們去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想把那些病人帶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得這才是這群人的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"綁架......感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是什麼道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人的目的撲朔迷離，但這並不是眼下最緊要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"目前，最好的辦法是等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"等待？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然目前沒有任何徵兆，但是只從既成事實的角度來談的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有獲得王酋的許可，就持械進入了王酋的領地。無論於王酋的戒律還是本地的法律，我們都已經犯了薩爾貢的大忌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮上的貴族深陷兵馬之亂，但他們在此地的統治依然存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"此時再插手任何事情，都會讓情況對我們更加不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"本地領主設立了感染者社區，說明他不是殘暴無情之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"他同意羅德島在這裡設立安全屋，說明他不是封閉自守之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信他會給我們一個公正的待遇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"國家律法......地方政府......我能理解。那現在也只能希望如此了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"在有更多情況變化之前，我們要固守這個安全屋，等待鎮上的騷亂結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你們能夠幫助我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不用客氣，我們也需要羅德島的專業支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，四位，合作愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["ASH"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["BLITZ"]},{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["FROST"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["TACHANKA"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
